    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "To be and to live",
     "texto": [
      "**Είμαι** (I am) changes with the person: **είμαι, είσαι, είναι**. For you (formal or plural) we use **είστε**.",
      "**Μένω** means «I live» and **δουλεύω** means «I work». Verbs ending in **-ω** usually take these endings in the present: **μένω, μένεις, μένει**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
